ind":"announcement","title":"You are always holding something in Burger Smash. That used to be a problem...","summary":"Before the demo goes live tomorrow, a thank you to everyone who playtested Burger Smash.You played builds that were slower than they should have been, and you told us exactly where they dragged. The biggest thing we changed because of you is how your hands work.In Burger Smash you are always holding something. A patty, a bun, tomatoes, a take away bag. Until now, if you were holding one thing and needed another, you had to find a free spot, put the first thing down, then go and pick up the secon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T14:04:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4664490-1844115010499141","game_id":"steam-4664490","kind":"announcement","title":"The Kitchen Opens Thursday","summary":"The Burger Smash playtest goes live this Thursday the 24th and runs until Sunday the 27th.Before you jump in, here is something worth knowing.Most players assume the hardest part is cooking the burgers. It is not.The hardest part is the decision you make before a single customer arrives, where does everything go? The grill. The prep station. The serving counter. Get it right and orders flow. Get it wrong and you will spend the whole level running in circles while your customers lose patience and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T15:33:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499141","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4664490-1841579228670907","game_id":"steam-4664490","kind":"announcement","title":"What happens before the first order changes everything...","summary":"When you start a level in Burger Smash, before a single customer walks through the door, you're staring at an empty kitchen. This is the placement phase.The placement menu is where you decide everything. Where does the grill go? How close is it to the counter? Where are your toppings stations sitting relative to where you'll be running back and forth? Every piece of equipment you place is a decision about how your service is going to flow once the orders start piling up.Here's the thing most peo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T06:57:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670907","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4664490-1839676055882632","game_id":"steam-4664490","kind":"announcement","title":"Burger Smash is officially announced... Day 1 recap","summary":"Yesterday we announced Burger Smash and we are blown away by the early response. In the first 24 hours we hit 219 Steam impressions, 208 store visits and picked up our first 4 wishlists. Every single one means the world to us as a two person team on our first game.Watch the announce trailer here: Thank you for the support... this is just the beginning.Antony & Lumbi Alnutmob","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T14:04:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055882632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4664490-1839041357038607","game_id":"steam-4664490","kind":"announcement","title":"Be the First to Taste the Chaos...","summary":"We're hard at work grilling away on Burger Smash, and we want you involved before launch.Sign up to our mailing list and you'll be the first to hear when beta invites go out. We'll also send dev updates and behind-the-scenes content along the way, about two emails a month, no spam.Sign Up for Beta AccessAntony & LumbiAlnutmob","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T15:21:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4664490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4664490":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4664490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5266530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:19:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4664490","app_id":4664490,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:46Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a6289564cf3861eff2a7833fa0a82f6664465648c99572b0c9ab50050e2d17ff","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"빠른 템포의 싱글 플레이어 요리 게임에서 주방을 계획하고, 버거를 굽고, 주문이 끊이지 않게 하세요. 효율적인 배치를 설계하고, 압박 속에서 주문을 준비해 서빙하며, 고유한 특전을 가진 플레이 가능한 캐릭터를 잠금 해제하고, 까다로운 손님들을 만족시키세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Alnutmob","creator_clan_account_id":46094762}],"developers":[{"name":"Alnutmob","creator_clan_account_id":46094762}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801382400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Burger Smash Announce Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps